<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="{{ seo.lang or 'en' }}">
{% set seo = {
  "title": country.title,
  "description": country.description,
  "keywords": country.keywords,
  "author": "Quickler Ltd",
  "canonical": "https://quickler.co/pages/country-hub-" + country.slug + ".html",
  "twitterCard": "summary_large_image",
  "hreflang": [
    { "lang": "en", "href": "https://quickler.co/pages/country-hub-" + country.slug + ".html" },
    { "lang": "x-default", "href": "https://quickler.co/pages/global-field-compliance.html" }
  ],
  "lang": "en"
} %}
{% include "partials/head.njk" %}
<body id="top" class="page-shell">

{% include "partials/nav.njk" %}

<main>

  <section class="page-shell about-page-intro">
    <span class="eyebrow">Quickler · {{ country.name }}</span>
    <img src="{{ country.flagSrc }}" alt="{{ country.flagAlt }}" width="60" height="45" style="margin-bottom:0.8rem">
    <h1>Quickler for field teams in {{ country.name }}.</h1>
    <p class="page-lede">Field inspection and compliance reporting over WhatsApp, structured digital records, no app required. Works anywhere WhatsApp does. Data hosted on EU servers. <a href="/pages/global-field-compliance.html">More about Quickler anywhere</a>.</p>
  </section>

  <section class="section-tight">
    <div class="section-header">
      <h2>Resources for {{ country.name }}</h2>
      <p>Three focused articles covering positioning, data privacy, and practical use cases.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="balanced-grid-3">

      <a href="/pages/positioning-{{ country.slug }}.html" class="card-link">
        <span class="card-link-kicker">Positioning</span>
        <h3>WhatsApp field compliance in {{ country.name }}</h3>
        <p>How field firms in {{ country.name }} run inspections and checklists via WhatsApp, with no app to install.</p>
      </a>

      <a href="/pages/data-privacy-{{ country.slug }}.html" class="card-link">
        <span class="card-link-kicker">Data &amp; privacy</span>
        <h3>Field inspection data and privacy in {{ country.name }}</h3>
        <p>EU-hosted data, GDPR-aligned. How structured digital records compare to paper for audit trails in {{ country.name }}.</p>
      </a>

      <a href="/pages/no-app-inspections-{{ country.slug }}.html" class="card-link">
        <span class="card-link-kicker">Use case</span>
        <h3>No-app site inspections for {{ country.name }} field teams</h3>
        <p>A practical look at how WhatsApp replaces paper and tablet apps for site safety and equipment checks.</p>
      </a>

    </div>
    <p style="margin-top:2rem"><a href="/pages/guides.html">← All guides and templates</a></p>
  </section>

  <section class="cta-section"><div class="cta-content">
    <h2>Run your compliance workflows over WhatsApp.</h2>
    <p>No app install. No training. Free to start, setup under a week.</p>
    <div class="hero-actions">
      <a href="https://app.quickler.co/signup" class="btn btn-primary">Start free</a>
      <a href="/pages/demo.html" class="btn btn-secondary">See a demo</a>
    </div>
  </div></section>

</main>

{% include "partials/footer.njk" %}
<script src="/js/analytics-events.js"></script>

</body>
</html>
